data: {"id": "eef6a598c9fa4e08-thinking-layer-274", "run_id": "eef6a598c9fa4e08", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "Pod `workload-68c557d875-llhkh` 仍处于 `Pending` 状态，且未分配到节点 (NODE=<none>)。这通常意味着调度器无法找到满足其资源需求或约束条件的节点。根据状态，最匹配的 Runbook 是 `pod-pending-unschedulable.md`，用于排查调度失败的原因（如资源不足、节点约束、污点等）。\n\n我将获取该 Runbook 以便后续进行更深入的分析。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788404576782}

