data: {"id": "eef6a598c9fa4e08-thinking-parallel_evidence-1971", "run_id": "eef6a598c9fa4e08", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，Pod 当前仍然是 **Pending** 状态，Node 为 `<none>`（未调度）。事件显示明确原因：**`3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector`**。\n\n关键发现：\n- **Node-Selectors**: `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`\n- **Tolerations**: 仅有 `node.kubernetes.io/not-ready:NoExecute` 的容忍\n\n这意味着 Pod 被调度到**所有标记了 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 的节点**上。但集群中可能没有（或现在没有）这样的节点，导致无法调度。\n\n让我验证这一点——检查集群中节点的标签情况：\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788404644353, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

