data: {"id": "eef6a598c9fa4e08-final", "run_id": "eef6a598c9fa4e08", "seq": 2518, "ts_ms": 1788404670405, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` | Pending | Pod设置了NodeSelector `aiops.lab/unavailable=true`，而集群中所有3个可用节点均缺少该标签，导致调度器无法找到匹配节点（PendingUnschedulable）。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | `default-scheduler` | `FailedScheduling`: `0/3 nodes are available: 3 node(s) didn't match Pod's node affinity/selector.` | 提供调度失败的直接机制与错误描述 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | `default-scheduler` | `FailedScheduling`: `Preemption is not helpful for scheduling..` | 排除抢占机制的补救可能 |\n| 3 | K8s State | `pod.condition` | `PodScheduled`: `False`, Reason: `Unschedulable` | 确认 Pod 持续处于不可调度状态 |\n| 4 | K8s State | `pod.phase` | `Pending` | 确认 Pod 运行阶段停滞在调度前 |\n| 5 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Pending\"}` = `1` (最近样本) | 量化确认 Pod 处于 Pending 状态的事实 |\n| 6 | Metric | `prometheus` | `kube_pod_status_phase{phase=\"Failed\"}` = `0` (最近样本) | 确认异常尚未进入 Failed 阶段，仅停留在调度环节 |\n\n**证据印证说明**：\nK8s 事件（事实 #1, #2）明确指出了 0/3 节点匹配失败的原因，K8s 状态（事实 #3, #4）与 Prometheus 指标（事实 #5, #6）分别从对象状态和指标数值两个维度相互印证了 Pod 持续处于 `Pending` 且无法调度的停滞现象。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nPod声明NodeSelector `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` → 集群3个节点均未配置该标签，调度匹配失败 → Scheduler持续返回FailedScheduling → Pod保持Pending状态，未分配到任何节点\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Pod 调度亲和性/选择器（NodeSelector）配置与集群节点标签不匹配**。\n*   Pod `aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh` 声明了 `aiops.lab/unavailable=true` 的 `NodeSelector`（事实关联：诊断状态）。\n*   集群当前可用的 3 个节点均不具备该标签，导致调度器（Default Scheduler）在所有节点上均无法匹配到亲和性规则，持续抛出 `FailedScheduling` 事件（事实 #1, #2）。\n*   因此 Pod 被永久阻塞在 `Pending` 状态，且由于无足够资源进行抢占（事实 #2），该状态将一直持续直至标签或选择器修正。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 45.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 45.5s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh: 45.5s (Evidence 38.0s, RCA 7.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.9s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-01/workload-68c557d875-llhkh**: pod-pending-unschedulable\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 100.198, "metrics": {"run_id": "eef6a598c9fa4e08", "mttr": {"value": "1.7m", "seconds": 100.2041244506836, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-pending-unschedulable", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-pending-unschedulable"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 100204.1244506836, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 93361.08684539795, "tool_calls": 19, "executed_tool_calls": 16, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 18, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 14552.525281906128, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 6326.133966445923}, "nodes"